  "translation": "Na i kamap stret gaden bilong Efron we i stap long Makpela, we i stap longpes bilong Mamre — ⟨em i⟩ gaden, na bilus we i stap insait long en, na olgeta diwai we i stap long gaden, we i stap long olgeta boda bilong em, olgeta hap klostu.",
